          "acting": {
            "gesture": "denial",
            "expression": "upset",
            "gaze": "right",
            "intensity": "medium"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "千早爱音",
          "text": "喂，soyorin！作者只是去沉淀了，你怎么就像给这个项目在念讣告！",
